					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's like a joke GoI format now, which is even weirder. I guess the Centre has jokes too? I suppose if you are hanging from a noose (being lowered into a shark tank) you probably do want gallows humor.</p> <p>I don't think this changes my vote though, it still is just incorrectly formatted in a really sloppy and obvious way, one that doesn't seem to be a deliberate choice. I would probably also downvote a -J if the SCPs had the Description and vice versa, unless that was the joke.</p> 
